{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"card":1,"entry":2,"missions":32,"alongside":33,"kin":34,"engines":59,"usedOn":60,"sites":69,"crewed":70,"museums":71,"hero":72},"https://www.orrerylearn.com/images/cards/fleet/rs-25.jpg",{"id":3,"name":4,"category":5,"agency":6,"country":7,"manufacturer":8,"first_flight":9,"status":10,"era":11,"epoch":12,"best_known_for":13,"specs":14,"science":21,"credit":24,"links":25,"tagline":30,"description":31},"rs-25","RS-25 (SSME)","engine","NASA","USA","Aerojet Rocketdyne","1981-04-12","ACTIVE","1981-2011","shuttle-and-mir","可重复使用的分级燃烧引擎——135次航天飞机飞行，现在在SLS上飞行",{"cycle":15,"propellant":16,"thrust_kn_vac":17,"isp_vac_s":18,"isp_sl_s":19,"mass_kg":20},"staged-combustion","LOX / LH2",2279,452,366,3527,[22,23],"propulsion/engine-types","propulsion/specific-impulse","Engine registry (PRD-032). Public-source nominal specs; NASA imagery.",[26],{"l":27,"u":28,"t":29},"RS-25 — Wikipedia","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/RS-25","intro","可重复使用、氢燃料驱动，仍在SLS上飞行","RS-25是Space Shuttle Main Engine计划花了十年打磨的发动机：以LOX和LH2为推进剂的分级燃烧循环，可调节推力、重新启动，并能在下次飞行前翻修。从1981年4月起，它在135次航天飞机任务中积累了近乎完美的运行记录。这些发动机被回收、检查并再次飞行——在这一功率等级上，此前没有任何火箭发动机做到过。航天飞机退役后，库存发动机经重新鉴定，改用于NASA的Space Launch System，RS-25现在为SLS的芯级提供动力。",[],[],[35,39,43,47,51,55],{"id":36,"name":37,"tagline":38},"f-1","F-1","迄今飞行过的最强力单室发动机",{"id":40,"name":41,"tagline":42},"j-2","J-2","将Apollo送上月球两次的引擎",{"id":44,"name":45,"tagline":46},"rl10","RL10","氢上面级，六十年生涯还在继续",{"id":48,"name":49,"tagline":50},"h-1","H-1","八台发动机，八次任务——Saturn I的主力发动机",{"id":52,"name":53,"tagline":54},"rocketdyne-a7","Rocketdyne A-7","发射第一位美国人进入太空的火箭发动机",{"id":56,"name":57,"tagline":58},"lr87","LR87","双燃烧室自燃推进剂第一级发动机，送出了每一个Gemini乘组",[],[61,65],{"id":62,"name":63,"tagline":64},"space-shuttle-stack","Space Shuttle堆栈","轨道器+ET+SRB;135次飞行任务",{"id":66,"name":67,"tagline":68},"sls-block-1","SLS Block 1","Artemis月球方案的重载",[],[],[],"/orrery/images/fleet-galleries/rs-25/01.webp"],"uses":{"params":["id"]}}]}
